{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@896","endTime":302766.265,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 02\nStreamDataX.\n\nA digital-asset website presentation with collection discovery, asset details, creator-oriented pages, and registration views.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nDigital assets & discovery\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nA visual gateway to digital collections.\n\nStreamDataX’s supplied website screens present a digital-asset marketplace through collection grids, individual asset information, and profile-style pages. A dark promotional identity sits alongside lighter browsing layouts. The preview caption refers to gig-worker management, but this presentation follows the digital-collection interfaces actually shown in the project-specific screen set.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in StreamDataX's original project material.\n\n01\nCollection discovery\n\nImage grids introduce the digital collections visible in the source designs.\n\n02\nAsset details\n\nA dedicated layout combines artwork with structured asset information.\n\n03\nProfile pages\n\nProfile-style headers and collection areas organize a creator-oriented view.\n\n04\nRegistration interface\n\nA separate form introduces account and onboarding information.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nDigital assets & discovery\n\nDeep navy, electric blue, and dimensional graphics establish the public-facing visual language. White catalog and detail panels give artwork and structured asset information a quieter setting, with a consistent header linking the different page types.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside StreamDataX.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n02\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n03\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n04\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n05\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nStreamDataX's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nStreamDataX / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nLittle Butterflies\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nCHILDCARE & FAMILY\nLittle Butterflies\nORGANIZATION & COLLABORATION\nTukeeConnect\nFASHION & COMMERCE\nBeliri\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
